    "question": "A body of emissivity e = 0.80 and surface area 0.050 m² is maintained at 500 K in an enclosure at 300 K. What is the net rate of radiative heat loss from the body? (σ = 5.67 × 10⁻⁸ W/(m²·K⁴))",
